988.html","السريع"],[382,"يا صاح إسمع مذ سمت","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem66909.html","مجزوء الرجز"],[415,"هو الجواد الذي يلقاه مادحه","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem32215.html","البسيط"],[435,"أمن خدها الوردي افتنك الخال","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem40062.html","الطويل"],[435,"يا نائيا وفؤاد الصب مأواه","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem41023.html","البسيط"],[435,"كفي فإن سحاب الجفن قد وكفا","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem41398.html","البسيط"],[473,"الغيم يخلط نوحه ببكائه","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem60507.html","الكامل"],[580,"تذكرت أيام الصبابة والصبا","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem2767.html","الطويل"],[591,"لما رأت عشاقها قد أحدقوا","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem17630.html","الكامل"],[658,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/122756","الطويل"],[739,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/34407","الطويل"],[739,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/34422","الطويل"],[773,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/39146","البسيط"],[972,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/67842","الطويل"],[1109,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/61122","الطويل"],[1184,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/56124","البسيط"],[1400,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/137858",""],[1457,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/122086","الخفيف"],[1538,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/79863","السريع"],[1719,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/100955","الوافر"],[230,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/125388","المجتث"],[2208,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/95200","البسيط"],[2630,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/107322","الكامل"],[2678,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/137417",""],[2882,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/140080",""],[2883,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/100283","البسيط"],[2956,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/115614","السريع"],[3116,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/132618","البسيط"],[3236,"","https://poetry.dctabud